<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Saturday's Dutch</p>
<p>first division soccer matches:</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 1 (Roest 65th minute) Volendam 1 (De Bruyn</p>
<p>81th). Halftime 0-0. Attendance not available.</p>
<p>NAC Breda 0 Roda JC Kerkrade 1 (Vurens 23rd). 0-1. Attendance</p>
<p>12,121.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 1 (Van Hintum 90th) Twente Enschede 2 (Petrov</p>
<p>55th, Bruggink 86th). 0-0. 8,732.</p>
<p>Sparta Rotterdam 0 Feyenoord Rotterdam 1 (Larsson 46th). 0-0. </p>
<p>13,500.</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 0 Vitesse Arnhem 0. 27,700.</p>
